#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/AGENTS.md:103
msgid ""
"❌ `#include <memory>` → ✅ `#include \"ftl/scoped_ptr.h\"` or `#include "
"\"ftl/shared_ptr.h\"`"
