#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/AGENTS.md:105
msgid "**Functions and classes:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/AGENTS.md:106
msgid "❌ `std::move()` → ✅ `fl::move()`"
