#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/AGENTS.md:107
msgid "❌ `std::vector` → ✅ `fl::vector`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/AGENTS.md:108
msgid "❌ `std::string` → ✅ `fl::string`"
