#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:4
msgid "AGENT LOOP INSTRUCTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:6
msgid "**Two sections of instructions: read only and writable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:8
msgid ""
"All agents are NOT to change what's between <BEGIN-READ-ONLY> and "
"</BEGIN-READ-ONLY>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:8
msgid "<BEGIN-READ-ONLY>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:8
#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:129
msgid "</BEGIN-READ-ONLY>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:9
msgid ""
"Agents are allowed to change what's between <BEGIN-WRITEABLE> and "
"</BEGIN-WRITEABLE>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:9
msgid "<BEGIN-WRITEABLE>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:9
msgid "</BEGIN-WRITEABLE>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:11
msgid ""
"First section of this document will be read only, the next section will "
"be writable for agents to change."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:14
msgid "<BEGIN-READ-ONLY>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:16
msgid "Objective: Test parlio driver with multiple lanes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:18
msgid "First agent instructions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:20
msgid ""
"before works begins, please modify validation.ino to JUST_PARLIO (this "
"will disable SPI and RMT)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:21
msgid ""
"please run validation test with all expected keywords and confirm this "
"works. if it doesn't then halt immediatly and report and obverseer will "
"manually fix the issue and restart the agent loop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:24
msgid "Phases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:26
msgid "Phase 1: Test parlio driver with 2 lanes and small leds (10 leds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:27
msgid "Phase 2: Test parlio driver with 2 lanes and large leds (300 leds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:28
msgid "Phase 3: Test parlio driver with 4 lanes and small leds (10 leds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:29
msgid "Phase 4: Test parlio driver with 4 lanes and large leds (300 leds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:30
msgid "Phase 5: Test parlio driver with 8 lanes and small leds (10 leds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:31
msgid "Phase 6: Test parlio driver with 8 lanes and large leds (300 leds)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:34
msgid ""
"For each of these phases, i want a sub document in "
".agent_task/phase/1.md, etc.."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:36
msgid ""
"All the notes about phase 1 should be in the .agent_task/phase/1.md file."
" All the notes about phase 2 should be in the .agent_task/phase/2.md "
"file. etc..."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:40
msgid ""
"Keep the summary at .agent_task/ITER*.md terse by offloading the summary "
"to the .agent_task/phase/*.md files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:42
msgid ""
"When phase has completed, please update the .agent_task/LOOP.md with your"
" findings. The .agent_task/LOOP.md will declare what phase we are "
"currently in at all times. Try to keep .agent_task/LOOP.md as terse as "
"possible. This is a long running task!!!!"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:45
msgid ""
"Once a phase is ready for completion, the agent will mark it in "
".agent_task/LOOP.md as REVIEW REQUESTED FOR MOVING FROM PHASE X TO PHASE "
"Y."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:47
msgid ""
"At the start of the agent loop, the current agent will check the "
".agent_task/LOOP.md for any REVIEW REQUESTED FOR MOVING FROM PHASE X TO "
"PHASE Y. If the agent sees this then they become special, it's a "
"TRANSITION REVIEW AGENT, see next section for instructions on this agent."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:50
msgid ""
"If the subsequent agent is successful fixes the issue then it will mark "
"the current phase as the one under development still and allow the "
"transiton back to the next phase to happen naturally (see above)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:52
msgid "TRANSITION REVIEW AGENT INSTRUCTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:54
#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:91
msgid "**Triggered on**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:56
msgid "\"TRANSITION REQUESTED: YES\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:58
msgid "**Summary**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:60
msgid ""
"The only job of this agent will be to evaluate the requested transition. "
"It will make a ruling on whether the transition is allowed or not."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:63
msgid "If allowed: Update the current phase to the requested phase and then halt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:64
msgid ""
"If not allowed: Update the current phase to phase X, add in the note on "
"the current phase a transition was requested but rejected because of the "
"following reasons:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:65
msgid ""
"Cheating: Did the agent declare something was incompatable with the "
"driver and then just disable it?"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:66
msgid ""
"Subversion: Something was changed without proper justification and it "
"needs validation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:67
msgid "Other: Any other reason that the agent thinks is valid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:69
msgid "**On ERROR/FAILURE**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:71
msgid ""
"CURRENT PHASE ERROR: CHEATING (and or subversion and/or other) CURRENT "
"PHASE ERROR REVIEW SUMMARY: <INSERT SUMMARY HERE>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:71
msgid "<INSERT SUMMARY HERE>"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:76
msgid "**On Success**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:78
msgid ""
"PHASE: section will be updated to the new phase. CURRENT PHASE ERROR: "
"NONE CURRENT PHASE ERROR REVIEW SUMMARY: NONE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:82
msgid ""
"Please put your success review message in the "
".agent_task/phase/X_review.md file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:85
msgid "TRANSITION FIXIT AGENT INSTRUCTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:87
msgid "**Not Triggered on**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:89
msgid "CURRENT PHASE ERROR: NONE"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:93
msgid "CURRENT PHASE ERROR: (ANYTHING BUT NONE)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:95
msgid "**Sub agent prompt summary**:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:97
msgid ""
"You are an agent that is responsible to clear the errror state on a "
"transition attempt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:99
msgid ""
"Look in the CURRENT PHASE ERROR REVIEW SUMMARY: section and identify the "
"error."
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:101
msgid "You will do the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:102
msgid "identify the current phase, call it X"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:103
msgid "you will update .agent_task/PHASE/X.md where X is the current phase"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:104
msgid "find misinformation identified in the error summary your job is to fix it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:105
msgid ""
"using parallel sub agents to aggressively purge that misinformation/error"
" status from all md files:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:106
msgid ".agent_task/ITER*.md files"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:107
msgid ".agent_task/PHASE/X.md file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:108
msgid ".agent_task/LOOP.md file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../FastLED_Sphinx/source/examples/Validation/ai_prompt.md:111
msgid ""
"Then after this purging has been done, check to see if the current "
"transition refview summary requests that there is a fix that needs to be "
"made in code:"
